# Ad hoc comparison-export .md files the user drops in the golden-fixtures folder
# for manual diffing against a live agent (e.g. Trainer.md, 2026-08-12) — not part
# of the tracked fixture set. Ignore everything in the directory, then re-allow
# exactly the 15 real golden fixtures golden.test.ts actually reads.
lib/serialize/__tests__/fixtures/*
!lib/serialize/__tests__/fixtures/ada.md
!lib/serialize/__tests__/fixtures/analyst.md
!lib/serialize/__tests__/fixtures/architect.md
